<title>USA: FERRELLGAS ACQUIRES 4 PROPANE RETAILERS.</title>
<headline>FERRELLGAS ACQUIRES 4 PROPANE RETAILERS.</headline>
<dateline>LIBERTY, Mo. 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ferrellgas Partners LP said Monday it has acquired four LPG retailers for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>The partnership said the acquisition of Bakers' L.P. Gas Inc in Four Oaks, N.C.; J.H. Conger &amp; Son Inc in Edentown, N.C.; Harvey Gas and Appliances on Booneville, Ky.; and Korsmo Oil &amp; Supply in Northwood, N.D., add nearly 2,w300 customers and more than 1.7 million annual retail sales.</p>
<p>Ferrellgas said the acquisitions bring to 33 the number it has completed since becoming a limited partnership in 1994.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
